{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと数時間後ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニッポン放送\n「ラジオ・チャリティ・ミュージックソン 新内眞衣のオールナイトニッポンR」\nに出演させていただきます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週、先月も\nANNに出演させてもらったばっかなのに\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも\nミュージックソンに出れるってすごい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3時台、4時台\n生放送で出演させていただきますので\nみなさんも一緒にこの時を過ごしましょー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなクリぼっち回避じゃん、やったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いて～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは西 恵利香さん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田のアシスタンスMC危機！！\nぺろぺろミッドナイト希望です` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってますが今回も楽しかった～\n西さんの安定感ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小指やら咳やら心配させてしまい\nすみません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西さんがずっと心配してくれてた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に優しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小指はね\n普通に料理中にやっちゃったやつなんで\n全然、大丈夫！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"咳の方は\nまた風邪ひいた、というよりは\n先週からずっと治ってない状態ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然、熱とかはすぐ下がったのに\n咳だけは夜になるとでてきちゃうのかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな聴いてくれてありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年、最後の生放送と観覧\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めりーくりすまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスケーキでしょ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず去年のです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/12/24/9062593/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ヨロイヅカファーム・トーキョー』のです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のも載せていくね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}